  data: {
    LLM: '1. No obligation to follow suit initially.\n2. After each trick, players draw 1 card from the stock to stay at 5 cards.\n3. Once the stock is empty, players must follow suit (in some variations).\n4. The highest card of the suit led wins, unless someone trumps it.',
    Player: '1. No obligation to follow suit initially.\n2. After each trick, players draw 1 card from the stock to stay at 5 cards.\n3. Once the stock is empty, players must follow suit (in some variations).\n4. The highest card of the suit led wins, unless someone trumps it.',
    objective: "Score 501 points through tricks and 'Marianna' bonuses.",
    gameplay: '1. No obligation to follow suit initially.\n2. After each trick, players draw 1 card from the stock to stay at 5 cards.\n3. Once the stock is empty, players must follow suit (in some variations).\n4. The highest card of the suit led wins, unless someone trumps it.',
    keyRules: [
      'No obligation to follow suit; play any card. Trick won by highest of led suit, or highest trump if any trumps played.',
      'After each trick, winner draws first then each player in order so everyone has five cards again. Winner leads next trick.',
      'Declare marianna (king and queen of same suit) at your turn to score bonus and set or change trump. First 40, second 60, third 80, fourth 100 points.',
      'After the last card is drawn from the stock, no more mariannas; last five tricks played from hand without drawing.',
